 "id": "seg2",
 "title": "先攻破人",
 "pill": 2,
 "total": 103.67,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg2-00",
   "text": "先给准确的说法。",
   "spoken": "先给准确的说法。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg2-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.232,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 2.983
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-01",
   "text": "社会工程，就是靠欺骗或利用信任，让人自己动手，做攻击者需要的事。",
   "spoken": "社会工程，就是靠欺骗或利用信任，让人自己动手，做攻击者需要的事。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg2-01.mp3",
   "start": 4.052,
   "dur": 6.72,
   "speechStart": 4.15,
   "speechEnd": 9.935
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-02",
   "text": "内部人风险，是有合法权限的人，有意或无意地造成损失。",
   "spoken": "内部人风险，是有合法权限的人，有意或无意的造成损失。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg2-02.mp3",
   "start": 10.992,
   "dur": 5.544,
   "speechStart": 11.09,
   "speechEnd": 15.685
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-03",
   "text": "最贵的漏洞，常常不在合约里，而在员工的电脑上。",
   "spoken": "最贵的漏洞，常常不在合约里，而在员工的电脑上。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg2-03.mp3",
   "start": 16.756,
   "dur": 4.992,
   "speechStart": 16.854,
   "speechEnd": 20.925
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-04",
   "text": "攻击者不去破解多签合约，他让一个签名人，在自己电脑上打开一个文件。",
   "spoken": "攻击者不去破解多签合约，他让一个签名人，在自己电脑上打开一个文件。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg2-04.mp3",
   "start": 21.968,
   "dur": 6.048,
   "speechStart": 22.066,
   "speechEnd": 27.185
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-05",
   "text": "之后，这台电脑上显示的一切，都可能是假的。",
   "spoken": "之后，这台电脑上显示的一切，都可能是假的。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg2-05.mp3",
   "start": 28.236,
   "dur": 4.656,
   "speechStart": 28.334,
   "speechEnd": 32.06
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-06",
   "text": "打个比方，金库有三道门，三个人各管一把钥匙。",
   "spoken": "打个比方，金库有三道门，三个人各管一把钥匙。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg2-06.mp3",
   "start": 33.112,
   "dur": 4.68,
   "speechStart": 33.21,
   "speechEnd": 36.96
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-07",
   "text": "窃贼不撬门，他给三个掌钥人，各寄了一封老同事的来信。",
   "spoken": "窃贼不撬门，他给三个掌钥人，各寄了一封老同事的来信。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg2-07.mp3",
   "start": 38.012,
   "dur": 5.04,
   "speechStart": 38.11,
   "speechEnd": 42.205
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-08",
   "text": "信纸上涂了药，读过信的人，第二天会记错自己开的是哪道门。",
   "spoken": "信纸上涂了药，读过信的人，第二天会记错自己开的是哪道门。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg2-08.mp3",
   "start": 43.272,
   "dur": 5.928,
   "speechStart": 43.37,
   "speechEnd": 48.381
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-09",
   "text": "比喻在这里不成立，真实的攻击者，不需要同时骗三个人。",
   "spoken": "比喻在这里不成立，真实的攻击者，不需要同时骗三个人。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg2-09.mp3",
   "start": 49.42,
   "dur": 5.136,
   "speechStart": 49.518,
   "speechEnd": 53.72
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-10",
   "text": "签名人的电脑都运行同一个前端，攻破其中几台，再配合篡改前端，就可能凑够门槛。",
   "spoken": "签名人的电脑都运行同一个前端，攻破其中几台，再配合篡改前端，就可能凑够门槛。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg2-10.mp3",
   "start": 54.776,
   "dur": 7.608,
   "speechStart": 54.874,
   "speechEnd": 61.54
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-11",
   "text": "攻击者能控制的，通常是这五样东西。",
   "spoken": "攻击者能控制的，通常是这五样东西。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg2-11.mp3",
   "start": 62.604,
   "dur": 3.72,
   "speechStart": 62.702,
   "speechEnd": 65.487
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-12",
   "text": "一个假身份，冒充招聘者、前同事、合作方或者记者。",
   "spoken": "一个假身份，冒充招聘者、前同事、合作方或者记者。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg2-12.mp3",
   "start": 66.544,
   "dur": 5.976,
   "speechStart": 66.642,
   "speechEnd": 71.701
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-13",
   "text": "一个任务，比如测试题、代码作业、一份复盘 PDF。",
   "spoken": "一个任务，比如测试题、代码作业、一份复盘 PDF。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg2-13.mp3",
   "start": 72.74,
   "dur": 5.4,
   "speechStart": 72.838,
   "speechEnd": 77.302
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-14",
   "text": "一个会议，比如假会议软件，或者远程控制请求。",
   "spoken": "一个会议，比如假会议软件，或者远程控制请求。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg2-14.mp3",
   "start": 78.36,
   "dur": 4.872,
   "speechStart": 78.458,
   "speechEnd": 82.398
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-15",
   "text": "一笔钱，用来收买客服或外包人员。",
   "spoken": "一笔钱，用来收买客服或外包人员。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg2-15.mp3",
   "start": 83.452,
   "dur": 3.864,
   "speechStart": 83.55,
   "speechEnd": 86.478
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-16",
   "text": "还有一个被雇用的身份，冒名应聘远程岗位。",
   "spoken": "还有一个被雇用的身份，冒名应聘远程岗位。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg2-16.mp3",
   "start": 87.536,
   "dur": 3.984,
   "speechStart": 87.634,
   "speechEnd": 90.669
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-17",
   "text": "公开通报显示，朝鲜相关组织在这类攻击中最活跃。",
   "spoken": "公开通报显示，朝鲜相关组织在这类攻击中最活跃。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg2-17.mp3",
   "start": 91.74,
   "dur": 4.776,
   "speechStart": 91.838,
   "speechEnd": 95.683
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-18",
   "text": "但手法本身被各类犯罪团伙复用，防御不该只盯着一个组织。",
   "spoken": "但手法本身被各类犯罪团伙复用，防御不该只盯着一个组织。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg2-18.mp3",
